Today is Thursday afternoon.
I am in the office.
I am drinking coffee with my colleague Rohan.
We are talking about free time.
Rohan asks, "Maya, where are you going this evening?"
I say, "I always go to the gym on Tuesday and Thursday evenings."
"But I like to meet new people."
Rohan says, "Then why don't you play a new sport?"
I smile and say, "I like to play badminton very much."
"I can play this sport very well."
Rohan says, "There is a very good badminton club nearby here."
"Many people come there every evening."
I am very happy.
I am asking Rohan for the address of the club.
He is showing me the way to the club on his phone.
I have made a new decision.
Now I will not go to the gym on Thursdays.
I will go to play badminton every Thursday.
I will go to that club this evening at half past five.
I am ready to meet new people.
